    "title": "Black America's compassionate response to Charlie Kirk's assassination - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elwood Watson ,\n8 days ago The assassination of Charlie Kirk is a tragedy and part of a horrifying wave of political violence in America. Kirk was a husband and father of two small children. He was revered by numerous conservative college students. One could be hard pressed to name many conservative political personalities in America who were more well-known or popular on the right, especially among younger people. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
